WEBVTT

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:42.580
We really hate the name "Players"...

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.670
...because it's the name humans gave to us as their toys.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:05.180
But now the stage has moved above ground,

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:07.350
and the meaning of that name has seriously changed.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:10.520
We've labeled ourselves with pride.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.730
We're Players!

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:17.780
Come on!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:19.410
If you're going to kill someone, kill me!

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:26.040
Kouga-kun, stop it already!

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.040
You're going to die!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.540
Episode 11: Puppet

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.440
Oh, my...

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:59.450
A spectacular guest has joined in!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.120
Run away.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.240
Hurry up and go!

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.460
You went to all the trouble of coming, but this farce is over already.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.880
I didn't think you'd come participate with the Players.

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.250
Ouch...

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.460
This again...

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.680
No! Let me go!

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.560
Don't you want to meet that guy?

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:30.480
We, the Players, and that guy,

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:34.650
were created by the world-famous Amagi Corporation...

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.520
...to produce explosive profits for them.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.530
To all you humans being killed now:

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:42.780
If you're going to blame somebody, blame the Amagis.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.290
It's strange.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.330
Even though I'm in a situation like this,

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:57.420
and even though I'm hurting this much...

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.510
This... This feeling!

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.010
This is justice!

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:09.890
Is this a Player?!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.380
Shooting Mode.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:40.340
Enforcing justice!

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:53.770
Are you OK?

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.770
I-I'm fine, father.

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.360
You didn't pass the test.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.730
I'm ending this!

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:04.610
Then let the girls go.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.610
All right...

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.240
I'll release them.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.700
Everyone, you're safe no-

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.500
Murderer!

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.330
It's your fault!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.540
You murderer!

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.500
It's as if you killed them yourself!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.130
Quit it!

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.380
What's wrong with you all?

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:24.760
He saved all of you!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.720
I'm not his fan anymore!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:27.680
Me neither!

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.470
Hurry up and let us out of here!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:30.510
You guys...

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:38.400
Hey, look... Isn't that the elevator?

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:40.820
Let's get out of here.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:41.860
Yeah.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.200
You go, too.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.450
I can't go.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.370
But...

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.120
It's not over yet!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.330
I understand.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:58.080
Well, then, I'll be leaving ahead of you.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.670
I believe in you.

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:03.250
No matter what anybody says, you're a hero.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.510
You risked your life to save everyone.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.760
Next time we meet, I want a signature for myself!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.980
Wait!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.710
I released them, just as promised...

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.670
...from this hell on earth.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.470
Kouga... kun.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.270
You're safe!

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:05.900
I'm glad.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:07.690
Was anyone else-?

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.860
There was someone else there.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.660
It must've been the person you're looking for!

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.870
Is it Konoha?

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.830
Come on.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.920
Could it be... she's part of the test, too?

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.420
But I have no choice but to go!

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.430
Konoha might be there!

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.100
'Scuse me, let me through!

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.060
Police coming through.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:41.600
What the-?

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.020
Sorry.

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.920
Jin?

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.420
Is that you, old man?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.170
What just happened with you now?

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.920
You're one of them!

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.050
Monster!

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:18.010
He's in my custody!

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.810
I have him in my custody!

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:22.730
You're coming with me.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:24.940
Sorry, old man.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:31.570
The president of Amagi Group, Amagi Seizou,

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.570
will soon be holding a press conference.

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:37.320
What will he have to say about the incident in Middletown?

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.490
I just can't like the Amagis.
What will he have to say about the incident in Middletown?

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:41.160
I just can't like the Amagis.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:44.870
Um, can I use your phone?

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.170
Sure, be my guest.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:46.630
We have a broadcast set up on location.
Sure, be my guest.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:47.920
We have a broadcast set up on location.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:56.300
The people who took in Jin sent out a representative from Amagi, too.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.010
They handed over a huge sum of money,

00:08:58.010 --> 00:08:59.930
saying it was to fix my face.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.350
But it just kind of pissed me off,

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:02.560
so I gave it all back right there.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.390
So things like that happened, too?

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:09.060
Well, yeah, but you're a good Amagi!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.190
Ah, hello? Okaa-san?

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.330
You!

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:31.050
There's a huge flaw in your justice.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:32.840
What could it be?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.130
Please get out of the way!

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.480
You're one of them?

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.730
Come in.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:50.150
It's time for the answer!

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.700
I'll go ahead and introduce myself.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:08.080
I'm Nakata Jirou, and this child is my son Ichirou.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:13.340
You knew from the start that your little sister wasn't here, right?

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:17.380
You knew that your beloved "evil" was behind this test.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.470
That's why you took my request.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.550
You're wrong!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:25.060
You're always looking for some evil...

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.980
...in order to carry out your justice in a way that feels good.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:31.730
You let those girls die because you wanted me to be that evil.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.070
I wanted to save all of them! Truly!

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.740
What's bad about fighting for that?!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.950
You're mistaken about your objective.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.280
Fighting has become your objective,

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.990
and saving others is just a means of justifying that.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.160
When you were fighting the hammer man,

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:51.630
you were having fun, weren't you?

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.250
You weren't even thinking about the girls.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:59.300
And on top of that, that fire that turned you into a hero...

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.260
That was nothing more than coincidence.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.510
If you want to save people,

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:06.010
you need to use reliable methods.

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:08.180
In that situation, the correct answer...

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.230
...was to abandon the mother!

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.020
So I made the correct answer.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.070
What?

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.450
Back then, I tried to enforce the correct answer.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.780
But there was one more person there.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:30.410
I wasn't the one who saved that family!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.000
Are you aiming to be like Kanzaki Jin?

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:40.420
Why didn't you tell the truth?

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:43.720
Because my father refused to let me talk about Jin.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:45.510
No!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:48.680
Isn't it because you wanted to be called a hero?

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:52.480
As a result of that, a fault arose in your justice.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:56.320
You understand now what that fault is.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.480
It's cool-headedness.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:04.110
I thought something was up with you.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.450
Can you go towards Amagi Tower?

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.580
What?

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:12.040
This isn't a taxi, you know!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:16.290
Don't stand out, or you'll get in trouble like back there.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:18.590
You don't think I'm creepy?

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:19.130
Huh?

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:23.180
Why do you think I became a detective?

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.390
It's 'cause I can't transform myself.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:30.390
You have to keep a cool head to defeat evil.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.640
What's happening to your face?!

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:40.150
Otou-san!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.030
Your medicine!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.570
Drink your medicine!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.740
You should watch closely.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:59.420
The way we look now is proof of your father, Amagi Seizou's evil!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.760
My father?!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.050
What are you?

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:03.920
Are you Players?

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.890
We're humans!

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.760
In order to live, we planted the abilities of the Players...

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.560
...in our bodies!

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:20.650
If we hadn't, I wouldn't have been able to bring my son back to life...

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:21.940
...on the day that he died.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:27.410
I created the Players just like Seizou ordered me to.

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:30.410
I was complacent in his debauchery.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.580
But I opened my eyes to the Players' rebellion,

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.710
and I tried to announce it all to the public.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.250
But your father buried me alive...

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:44.260
...in the underground research laboratories.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:46.590
He thought you'd be lonely by yourself,

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.340
so he brought me along,

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.850
and I soon used the last of my strength.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.600
But I didn't despair.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.600
I was in the research lab.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.600
I had the technology to bring forth Players.

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.730
I wouldn't let my son die!

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:03.860
You fused together a human and a Player?!

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.900
Exactly!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:09.160
I spent a long time with nothing but my
hatred for Amagi Seizou keeping me alive,

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:15.160
and vengeance was the only thing I continued to teach my reborn son.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.370
And then he appeared.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:22.500
The closed laboratories have an extra freebie.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.760
How lucky.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.880
The Players kept us alive.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:33.310
We'll join forces with anyone who can make the Amagis suffer.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:38.100
And my dream is to make you suffer like my son Ichirou did.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.810
And then for the final touch,

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:44.020
you'll kill your father with your own hands!

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.320
And what would you gain by doing that?!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.700
Nothing!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.240
That's what vengeance is all about.

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.490
It leaves behind nothing but an empty void.

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.500
But it is cruel!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.830
Your father is the reason for your suffering,

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:01.790
and it's his fault those girls died, too!

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:06.550
Jirou-san, you're getting too worked up.

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:09.170
Hayami-san?!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.090
Don't move.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.390
What're you doing?

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.100
Stop this!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.310
If you do anything stupid, I'll die.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.140
Nicely done, Ichirou-kun.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.350
I don't want any harm to come to Kouga-kun.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.150
What did you do to her?!

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.360
I'm controlling her with a piece of myself.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:33.320
Hayami, now's the time to get worked up.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:36.410
My revenge is entering its final stage.

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:38.370
I understand the way you feel,

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.620
but you need to follow my plan.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.330
You're with them?!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:46.340
I want the Amagi Group.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:49.460
So I lent a hand to Jirou-san's revenge.

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:03.100
Like I've said countless times,

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:05.360
we're perplexed by this as well.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:10.190
The words of this man in Middletown calling himself a "Player"...

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:12.320
...were only unfounded rumours.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.160
No!

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:15.240
It's the truth!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:17.240
What did you say?

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.120
I'm telling you it's the truth!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.340
Kabe-san's with me, too.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:30.760
This is going just as we planned.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.760
Sit down, Kabe!

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.760
Everything that that "Player" said was the truth!

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:41.680
Up until now, he's told me all kinds of
classified information about the company.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:42.520
But...

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:45.980
Even now the president is conspiring together with the Players,

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:47.770
and he's assisting in their activities by providing funding.

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:50.230
The proof's in here!

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:55.200
That tragedy in Middletown was a farce
put on by the president and the Players!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.530
Furthermore, he's trying to make even more profits for himself...

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:01.620
...by creating this mayhem so he can sell his company's weapons to the world!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:02.290
Kabe!

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:06.290
When it comes to people knowing secrets, the fewer the better.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:18.930
I proclaim this to be truth with my own death!

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:29.810
He was possessed by these wild delusions!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:33.440
He doesn't even lament the death of his closest underling.

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:37.070
That's the kind of person he is... Evil!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:41.370
If you don't have the will to kill him, I'll use a bug.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.370
You can't use a bug!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.750
I want Kouga-kun to be a <i>hero</i>.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:48.000
What are you trying to make me do?!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.960
A hero's job!

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.300
I like you.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.260
So that's why I've prepared the ultimate evil to be your opponent.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:18:00.970
If you can take down the president, you'll become the greatest hero.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:03.970
But then again, as far as I'm concerned,

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:08.270
there's no need to use a bug since I
could just control you using Alphas.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.400
Don't disgrace Alphas!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:12.520
Cutting Mode!

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.280
Cutting Mode.

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:21.410
Shooting Mode.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.720
Look what you've done...

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:46.980
I thought of you like an older brother.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:51.980
The puppet should've acted like a puppet...

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.580
This is...

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.380
You regained consciousness?

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:54.540
Good.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:55.880
Does anything hurt?

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.670
No, I'm fine.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:04.180
Kouga-kun!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.260
How did you know I was here?

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:11.480
A little while back, the system with information
about your location came back online all of a sudden.

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.940
It was really close, so we rushed over here.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:16.310
The air booster's been implemented, too.

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:18.900
You can make it to the press conference really quickly!

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:24.740
Yeah, yeah, time for the second act to start!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.740
I thought you'd come, monster.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:34.750
Fire!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:41.380
That won't have any effect.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.390
How mean of you.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:46.890
Aren't we supposed to be friends?

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:53.390
The Players are there!

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:58.060
This is my fight.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:03.450
Disengage the limiter.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:07.200
What? The backlash will be too strong!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:12.080
It'll put too much of a burden on you with how your body is now!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.790
I have to resign myself to a long fight.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.920
I want to use all of Alphas's strength.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:21.590
Well then, as the Players' representative,

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:24.420
I'll hold a Q&A session!

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:27.140
Who has questions for me?

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:28.850
I have one!

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:32.060
That guy!

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:36.320
He's the terrorist who destroyed the Amagi house!

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:37.940
Can you please stay out of this?

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.650
I won't let you do whatever you want anymore.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:43.070
I'll kill you.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.860
You think you can do it?

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:48.740
While you're white?

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:55.500
You're worthless without the red stone.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:58.670
I wouldn't mind dying...

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:01.170
...if you became complete.

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:16.180
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:23.020
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:29.280
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:35.950
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:45.510
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:51.340
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:58.180
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:09.610
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:17.250
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:28.670
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:39.210
In other words, that's my Charisma.

00:23:39.210 --> 00:23:41.560
Zetman is... the enemy?!

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:42.580
If I become evil, kill me!

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:45.550
Red Stake
If I become evil, kill me!

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:45.740
If I become evil, kill me!
